== self-test.  Every decision function must fire on a known-positive. ==
  Q-1 the quantile of a known set is exact             fires
  Q-2 and it interpolates                              fires
  Q-3 IQR of a uniform ramp is half its range          fires
  A-1 a converged sample is STABLE                     fires
  A-2 a sample dominated by two outliers is UNSTABLE   fires
  A-3 too few reps is UNSTABLE, not PASS               fires
  B-1 p25 above 100 is EXCELLENT                       fires
  B-2 p25 between 50 and 100 is TARGET                 fires
  B-3 p25 below 50 is BELOW TARGET                     fires
  B-4 exactly 50 HOLDS (the bar is inclusive)          fires
  C-1 a planted crossing is recovered exactly          fires
  C-2 identical fits give a zero-width band            fires
  C-3 a pessimistic band is narrower on the p25 side   fires
  C-4 fewer than three stable windows is REFUSED       fires

  14 of 14 fire.

